1
00:00:00,566 --> 00:00:02,836
(Bernadette:)You don't think she'd actually
send you something gross

2
00:00:02,835 --> 00:00:04,265
(Bernadette:)or dangerous, do you?

3
00:00:04,269 --> 00:00:06,839
(Penny:)I know one way
to find out... sniff this.

4
00:00:08,674 --> 00:00:11,944
(Amy:)She's pregnant,
she's not a bloodhound.

5
00:00:11,944 --> 00:00:13,744
(Bernadette:)Although I am getting
a little machine oil.

6
00:00:13,746 --> 00:00:15,416
(Bernadette:)I think it's metal.

7
00:00:15,414 --> 00:00:17,044
(Penny:)Come on, just open it.

8
00:00:17,049 --> 00:00:19,949
(Raj:)You know,
on Game of Thrones,

9
00:00:19,952 --> 00:00:23,792
(Raj:)Balon Greyjoy received
his son's genitals in a box.

10
00:00:23,789 --> 00:00:26,489
(Penny:)Well, never hurts
to have a spare.

11
00:00:29,495 --> 00:00:30,725
BERNADETTE:
What is that?

12
00:00:30,729 --> 00:00:33,529
(Raj:)Wow. It's an antique sextant.

13
00:00:33,532 --> 00:00:37,272
(Raj:)Sailors used these to find
their position by the stars.

14
00:00:37,269 --> 00:00:39,669
(Amy:)What a nice gift
for an astrophysicist.

15
00:00:39,671 --> 00:00:41,271
(Raj:)I know, she's so thoughtful.

16
00:00:41,273 --> 00:00:42,943
(Penny:)See, she's trying
to get you back.

17
00:00:42,941 --> 00:00:44,711
(Penny:)Now, that is exactly
what I would've gotten you

18
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:48,410
(Penny:)if I had any idea
what it is or what you do.

19
00:00:48,414 --> 00:00:51,614
(Raj:)You know, I have too much
self-esteem to let this girl

20
00:00:51,617 --> 00:00:53,917
(Raj:)guilt me into getting back
together with her.

21
00:00:53,919 --> 00:01:00,019
(Amy:)You don't need to be pregnant
to smell that load of crap.

